1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,033
7:05 PM. The intercom crackles again.

2
00:00:03,733 --> 00:00:06,967
Rule three. Count everyone in your
car. Know who's missing.

3
00:00:07,667 --> 00:00:10,200
Okay, car six. Call out your number.
One.

4
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:11,300
Two.

5
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:13,733
Three.

6
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:17,733
Four! Wait. Can I be sixty-seven?

7
00:00:18,433 --> 00:00:19,200
Six seven!

8
00:00:20,833 --> 00:00:23,633
Forty-one voices. Then the count stops
at forty.

9
00:00:24,333 --> 00:00:27,200
The old man by the door. He's fainted.
It's the heat.

10
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:32,800
Next to him, a wooden cane with a
faded Line Nine sticker. Nobody looks
at it twice.

11
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:36,433
Lift his feet. Fan him. Small sips of
water. Slowly.
